#: f602164f68e941838edc8fe30e352280 fdc5a7d9eea044339f50ce3fc87d36bc
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R6/TX6 (UART6_RX/UART6_TX) pins. It supports "
"all serial RC protocols. For protocols requiring half-duplex serial to "
"transmit telemetry (such as FPort) you should setup SERIAL6 with half-"
"duplex, pin-swap and inversion enabled."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R6/TX6（UART6_RX/UART6_TX）引脚上，支持所有串口 RC 协议。对于需要半双工串口发送数传的协议（如 "
"FPort），应将 SERIAL6 设置为启用半双工、引脚交换和反转。"

